5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. I believe looking at the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns would be wise.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with a cautious approach. I will look into the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am interested in the current state of our infrastructure. I'll check the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A very pragmatic start. I shall examine the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone! I'm looking forward to this. I think I'll check the station records from partner field sites and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
